{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03166","headline":"和裴侍中承恩拜扫旋辔途中有怀寄州县官僚乡国亲故 · 张九龄","name":"和裴侍中承恩拜扫旋辔途中有怀寄州县官僚乡国亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩岳神惟降，汾川鼎气雄。\n生才作霖雨，继代有清通。\n天下称贤相，朝端挹至公。\n自家来佐国，移孝入爲忠。\n霜露多前感，丘园想旧风。\n扈巡过晋北，问俗到河东。\n便道恩华降，还乡礼教崇。\n野尊延故老，朝服见儿童。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}